LOADHEX  R0 F  B !Load register 0 with value FB
PRINT    R0 0  0 !Print contents of register 0
LOADCELL R1 0  1 !Load cell 0x01's contents into register 1. Should be row 1, columnds 2 and 3 of the assembled hex code.
PRINT    R1 0  0 !Print contents of register 1
HALT     0  0  0 !Anything after an ! is explicitly a comment.